# `ccdeck preview 16` runs PR #16's ccdeck next to your own, on your real sessions, so you can try a
# change before it's merged or released. It gets its own config folder: transcripts, hook states and
# marks are shared (marks as a copy), while caches, token and daemon file are its own. Hooks keep
